SUMMARY:Review: Eastern Europe Lion’s Mane Coffee/Cocoa Market Share & Ranking
DESCRIPTION:Collaborative review of the 2026 Eastern Europe market-share and ranking analysis for the Lion’s Mane Coffee/Cocoa product in the Nootropic / Focus Drink category. Validate the market definition\, revenue inputs\, ranking approach\, the assumption that product revenue equals TAM expansion and represents 10% of total net regional revenue\, and percentage rounding to three decimal places. This session is for reviewing methodology and outputs\; no analytical findings are presumed.
